{
  "name": "dsh-qq-wake",
  "version": "0.5.4",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "跟 QQ 绑定的会话一叫就醒：插件加载时（也就是 DSH 刚起来时）把绑定里的会话挨个叫一遍，没活着的用 ctx.agents.resume() 提起来（带上 provider/model，不然醒了一跑就报 has no provider/model）；之后再用事件驱动 + 1.2 秒 stat 兜底盯 ~/.dsh/logs 当补充手段。设置面板带 provider 选项卡、自动列模型和思考强度、密钥 AES-256-GCM 加密落盘。",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "scripts",
    "README.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/waning-sun/dsh-qq-wake.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/waning-sun/dsh-qq-wake#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/waning-sun/dsh-qq-wake/issues"
  },
  "author": "waning-sun",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node scripts/selftest.mjs",
    "smoke": "node scripts/smoke-client.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "qq",
    "qq-link",
    "session",
    "resume",
    "watchdog"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "slots"
      ],
      "external": [
        "react"
      ]
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
